  "scope": "An independently generated fixed-axis XY chart shell was retained byte-for-byte except for series XML and embedded workbooks replaced by PPTKit internal builders. Four samples with missing X and unsorted data opened in PowerPoint 16.104, printed, then saved and reopened once. Source and saved caches, formulas and workbook cells were checked, and first-open marker boxes and line endpoints were compared with the independent native control. Captures do not independently prove provenance. This is a hybrid research artifact, not public PPTKit scatter export; native interactive editing, other producers, automatic axes and reopened PDF remain unverified.",
